39
00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:13.460
I also looked into Legal Aid Society.

40
00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:19.460
They actually provided a lot of really good insight and information as far as future plans

41
00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:23.460
